      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Ser Arisen, I'm countin' on you for the treasure\r\nhunt! Seems the Roaring Tide Cave's where it's at.",
        "Jp" : "覚者さん、財宝探しよろしく頼むよ！\r\n《潮騒洞窟》にあるらしいからさ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286142,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 12,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Gold and silver riches, or some\r\nwondrous work of art.\r\nWonder what it could be!\r\nI'll be waitin' on your tidings.",
        "Jp" : "金銀財宝か、すごい美術品か――\r\n何なんだろうな！\r\n報告楽しみに待ってるよ"
